    Bug 1978176 - Enable more rust lints. r=babolivier


    Most of these fall through the cracks of not being enabled by default by rustc
    because they're stylistic and don't indicate errors, yet aren't supported by
    clippy because they're already rustc lints.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D307312

diff --git a/python/rocbuild/rocbuild/rust.py b/python/rocbuild/rocbuild/rust.py
index dbb36ca92af..f41af8a9f76 100644
--- a/python/rocbuild/rocbuild/rust.py
+++ b/python/rocbuild/rocbuild/rust.py
@@ -118,6 +118,28 @@ assigning_clones = "warn"
 implicit_clone = "warn"
